I cannot remember the version number of the hack we used to play here, but
it must have been close to 1.0.2.  You may find that there is a wand of
wishing(!!) hidden on *each* of the maze levels -- have a look under all
the boulders on any maze level (break them with pickaxe if you can't push
them) until you find one.  Reading a scroll of object detection often
helps, since it will generally show the wands on the level and you can then
go straight to each spot a wand is and see if there is a boulder there (we
used to mark our VT100 screens with a pen to remember where each wand was
:-)).

